atever it is. So they do not initiate decisions: we're going to expand right now, we're going to start existing. So they would require an external agency or external thing.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Atheist Examines The Muslim Belief In God! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aymar_bEYMg", ((346, "5:46–6:17"), (379, "6:19–6:44"), (429, "7:09–7:49"), (483, "8:03–8:31"),), id: 36)
