e laws within the Universe, you cannot create the Universe. And you would have to have a will to place the things, which is the answer to why things are arranged in a way rather than in another way. We say, either way, people have to adopt this idea.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Sharia Law is Corruption?! Muhammed Ali - Speaker Corner”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R8lvyRvJ_tg", ((1213, "20:13–20:42"), (1250, "20:50–21:20"), (1305, "21:45–22:22"), (1379, "22:59–23:21"),), id: 68)
