#passage(("For every culture and every religion there's agreed upon attributes, like for example something created the universe, powerful, omnicient, omnipotent, Eternal and independent — these just basic attributes which everyone agrees upon.", "The Big Bang is just talking about an existence of material. Where do atoms come from? Science does not talk about why. Science talks about the function, so it talks about how something is, does not talk about why it is. So science is not going to tell you why the universe came into existence, and cannot explain to you what was happening before the Big Bang anyways.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Two Intelligent Jews Cross-Examine Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hJw2l-mJiFc", ((159, "2:39–2:52"), (210, "3:30–5:27"),), id: 76)
