#passage(("The problem of evil is only a problem for those who think God is only Good. When you understand that God is not only Good, He's also Just, He's also All-Knowing, there is no longer a problem with the evil that happens in the world, because the evil is intended from the beginning.", "I was saying Allah is not only good. That is not Sceptical Theism. That is us understanding that God is not limited to one attribute, and we cannot look at God from one perspective, just one attribute, and devoid Him or remove all of the other attributes of God and then base a worldview [around it] and say, \"OK, this is how it goes\". No! We say Allah, for example, is the Most Loving. Allah is the Most Just as well. Allah is the All-Knowing. So these are all attributes, and when you bring them together, you understand. When you say, \"Oh, it's something we cannot rationally understand\", I was offering you a rational explanation, which is the fact that this life is a test.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Emotional Atheist Receives A Reality Check From A Muslim! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ha146KFce5w", ((97, "1:37–1:49"), (155, "2:35–3:11"),), id: 316)
