#passage(("We're not Christians, which means we don't believe in the same idea. Islam gives answers for the ideas of the problem of evil or suffering or things that happen. Other religions do not have this; they do not have rational answers for these questions. In fact, the Quran already prepares you. Allah tells you, give glad tidings to those who are patient. Those who are true believers will be patient. \"God works in mysterious ways\" — that's a Christian phrase. I'll tell you why this is a Christian thing: because Christianity defies rationality and logic; it's not bound by it. That's why they say God is mystery. Talk about the trinity, God is a mystery. Talk about contradictions of Jesus identity. This is not Islam.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Atheist Presents Muslim With Difficult Questions! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NtXZBPaQ2NQ", ((813, "13:33–15:29"),), id: 320)

