#passage(("(And we will surely test you with something of fear, hunger, loss of life, loss of wealth, and give good tidings to the patient. Those who, when a disaster strikes them, say indeed we belong to Allah and to Him we shall return. Those are the ones who are upon them blessings from their Lord and mercy, and those are the rightly guided) (alBaqara2:155-157). Allah is saying (We will surely test you). You will be tested by people killing you, loss of life, loss of wealth, loss of land. Allah planned something else, or God planned something other than what you planned. He puts in this life tests for you.", "Allah says (al'Ankabut29:2-3) (Do you think We will leave you to say I believe, and you will not be tested? We surely have tested those who came before you. So Allah will make evident — make clear — those who believe and those who don't believe).",), "The Muslim Lantern, “A Christian Testimony About Islam Part 1! Muhammed Ali - Speakers Corner”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qLF3sGWkBek", ((1250, "20:50–21:47"), (1312, "21:52–22:02"),), id: 325)
