#passage(("Anything that you will do throughout your life would either have good influences or bad influences on something. Some things can be neutral, like if I scratch my head or something; these are neutral things. But generally the actions that we do will influence other people.", "\"Oh, I want to smoke.\" But whatever you're exhaling — which is 70% of it damage you're getting after your system has already filtered it — you're giving me something which is way worse than what you're smoking, and I'm inhaling it just for standing next to you or just crossing the road. You are influencing me negatively. So these are the choices that we make in this life. Some things would be subtle that people will not notice. He for sure knows he's damaging himself, because the packet itself tells him you're killing yourself. But some of them say, oh, we're not doing anything bad to anyone else. No, you are also doing it to other people.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Sincere Lady About To Accept Islam But This Happens! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2bQy_K4u5g", ((401, "6:41–6:56"), (432, "7:12–7:48"),), id: 327)
