#passage(("Allah promises in the Quran. He tells us, \"We will test you. We will surely test you. There's no doubt.\" The [lam] there in Arabic is for affirmation. It will happen. Allah tells us in the Quran the children of Israel, what they're going to do. Allah tells us, he speaks to them in chapter 17 of the Quran: \"You will cause corruption twice in the land. You will cause great corruption in the land.\" So, Allah is saying to us that this will happen. And if you return to righteousness and peace, then peace will come. So, everything is happening in front of us as Muslims. None of it surprises us. Because everything, how the world is functioning, if you have the manual, if you have the transcript of the life that is taking place, then nothing is surprising anymore.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Curious Couple Ask A Muslim To Explain World Suffering! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9AACeXB0A9Q", ((825, "13:45–14:54"),), id: 328)
