#passage(("Allahﷻ is ٱلرَّحۡمَـٰنُ ٱلرَّحِیمُ (Arrahmaan, Arraheem), He's The Most-Forgiving, The Most-Merciful. Allahﷻ says in the Quran: (Albaqara2:186) وَإِذَا سَأَلَكَ عِبَادِي عَنِّي فَإِنِّي قَرِيبٌۖ أُجِيبُ دَعۡوَةَ ٱلدَّاعِ إِذَا دَعَانِۖ (If my servants ask you about me, I'm near). Allahﷻ said that the Children of Israel will take the Masjid (The Aqsa Mosque) from you (Alisraa17:7), and they will cause great corruption (Alisraa17:4). So Allah has told us that we will be tested, afflicted. And Allah said (Ala'raf7:168) وَبَلَوۡنَٰهُم بِٱلۡحَسَنَٰتِ وَٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ لَعَلَّهُمۡ يَرۡجِعُونَ (So we can return to Allahﷻ). Because Allah has different soldiers, and some of these soldiers are much stronger. Like fear is stronger. It's a soldier of Allah, fear! Placing fear in someone's heart.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “IDF Soldier Confronted A Muslim Live Then THIS HAPPENED! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-qnYJXIxSpc", ((1341, "22:21–23:12"),), id: 329)
