#passage(("You will get the bad coming to you. I'm just an average man sitting on the Da'wah-table; you get a crazy woman walking by, trying to give you a flower. Who are you? I don't even know who you are! I've never seen you in my life! So you've got these things. Why? The Shaytan (Satan) tries to put these things in front of you. Not only that, but it's also tests from Allah.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “The Muslim Lantern Gets Sneak∅ To Rethink His Views! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ocg_ABofNVU", ((1248, "20:48–21:09"),), id: 330)
