#passage(("Tests make no sense for a being that knows every outcome. But the test is for the humans that don't know every outcome. They're not for the Creator! So we are the ones being tested; the tests are for us, because we're not perfect beings. So this is an illogical statement, because the one who's being tested is not The One Who knows everything. If you test God, then yes, that would not make any sense, because God knows everything.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| 5 Reasons I Left Islam?! Hijabi Says Christians Will Go To Heaven?! | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wIhGWmIQTJY", ((2291, "38:11–38:35"),), id: 336)

