#passage(("The Prophet told us already. He told us 2 things. First, in one Narration, the Prophet said he asked Allah for 3 things: that the whole Islamic Nation is not destroyed by a famine or a disease or something, and Allah granted him that. And he asked Allah that the whole Nation is not going to be destroyed by an enemy that all gather on them and completely annihilate Muslims, there is no more Muslims left, and Allah granted him that. Then he asked Allah that the أُمَّة (Nation) is not going to be divided, but Allah denied him that. So there will be division, and then these divisions will cause weakness, and that weakness will allow all of these nations to attack.", "The Prophet told us that (nations will gather upon you like the people gather on the feast). Like you see people gathering on the feast? We are going to be the feast! And they will persecute us and kill us. So (the Companion asked the Prophet, \"Will we be few in numbers?\") (The Prophet said, \"No, you will be like the foam on the sea\"). Look today, two billion people! Foam on the sea. Plenty of people. But the Prophet said, (the weakness وَهَن will happen to you,) (which is that \"you will love this life and you will hate death\"). So if you love the materialistic life and you hate death, then you become weak.", "Then you're saying, \"why is Allah allowing this?\", even though he told us this will happen 1400 years ago! Because THIS LIFE IS A TEST, and that's the whole point of why the Prophet is telling us: this is a test. Allah tells us in the Quran (alBaqara2:155): (We will test you with a loss of life, hunger and loss of wealth, and loss of children) (And give glad tidings to those who are patient). This is a test that we're in! Allah promised us this will happen. That's why you go to Paradise by passing the test. And test requires difficulties.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Wife Grills A Muslim With Difficult Questions! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tUX4xfgST_E", 