#passage(("I don't attempt to do so. We believe that's in the realm of Allah, القدر سر الله في خلقه (Destiny is God's secret in his Creation); that's what we say. And the Christians have 3 schools of thoughts as well, same thing: Libertarian, Deterministic and Compatibilistic. So either way, this idea, whether you're Muslim or not, you're Atheist or Jew, this discussion has been there since the beginning of time. I'm not going to finish it today. I believe that if Allah told me everything is written and He knows it, then it is True, because the Quran is True. And if Allah told me I'm choosing, and I know intuitively that I'm choosing, I don't need to reconcile anything; that's the reality. Just because I cannot rationally put it in words does not mean is false or incorrect.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Arab Christian Speaks The Truth About The Bible! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uxGJUgMQQSI", ((226, "3:46–4:25"),), id: 364)
