#passage(("I can know you're going home today; does not mean I'm forcing you to go home. I'll give an example. Let's say the World Cup is going to come. Let's say I go to the future and I know that Brazil are going to win the World Cup. And then I go back to the past and I'm watching Brazil winning the World Cup. Am I forcing them to win? So they, based on the choices that they made during the year and during the match and the preparation, was the result of them winning the World Cup. My prior knowledge to it did not influence their choices in a bit.", "So The Creator knows our choices. He knows it because we will choose it. It's not that we are choosing them because The Creator knows them.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Future Priest Attempts To Rescue A Christian Part1! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e7Uqvu7Sdjs", ((0, "0:00–0:29"), (37, "0:37–0:51"),), id: 371)
