#passage(("When you do something, you base it on your own judgement with the limited knowledge that you have, so you're making a free choice because you do not know what is going to happen in the future.", "And that's what Allah says in The (Quran6:148). People use the excuse (if Allah willed we would not have disbelieved or our forefathers before us) لَوْ شَاءَ اللَّهُ مَا أَشْرَكْنَا (we did not disbelieve if Allah willed). Then Allah says: هَلْ عِندَكُم مِّنْ عِلْمٍ فَتُخْرِجُوهُ لَنَا Do you have this evidence of the knowledge that you know you're going to be misguided? So you can show us this evidence that Allah has said you're going to be misguided? No! You do not have the evidence for the claim you're making; you're choosing misguidance right now, because you do not know where you're going to end up.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Tunisian Girl Questions Muslim On Women's Rights! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l68vK6nDhbA", ((374, "6:14–6:23"), (404, "6:44–7:14"),), id: 372)
