#passage(("Who says that the prayer alters God's plan and the prayer influences God? Nobody believes that. We don't believe that prayer influences God's plan, and alters God and influences Him. We don't believe that! We believe the prayer is an action that we ask God for something, and God either gives us that thing or doesn't give us that thing. Now, that is the choice or the decision of God. It doesn't alter anything, it doesn't influence anything. Now, us calling upon God and getting that thing or not getting that thing, God knows already. So there is nothing altered. God knows that you will ask on this specific day, and God knows if you will get that thing on that specific day, or you will not get that thing on that specific day. How does that alter the plan? Doesn't alter anything and it doesn't influence anyone.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| 5 Reasons I Left Islam?! Hijabi Says Christians Will Go To Heaven?! | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wIhGWmIQTJY", ((2234, "37:14–38:03"),), id: 379)
