#passage(("Belief in the Qadar! Wallahi, if you believed in the Qadar you will not have issues in your life. Anxiety, Depression, all of these things, you're not going to have them. Wallahi, if you believed in the Qadar the right way, I don't think any of you will have depression in his life. It's impossible. The minute you understand that everything that takes place, Allahﷻ is The One Who chose it, and (Allah only chooses good for the believers), the Prophetﷺ said. And that is either a test for me, or removing my sins so I'm not punished in the آخِرة (Akhira: Hereafter), or elevating my status. And this is Allah as The One Who chose it for me.", "So when I'm upset, I'm upset because Allah chose a good thing for me! I see it bad, yes? But, no! Allah chose a good thing for me and I'm upset! How could you get upset or get anxiety if you understood this concept? Wallahi, it's impossible! You can't! If you truly have the concept of Qadar in your heart and understand what Qadar means, you can't.", "Allah says (alHadid57:23) لِّكَيْلَا تَأْسَوْا۟ عَلَىٰ مَا فَاتَكُمْ (So you do not regret that which you missed). Because you knew you could not have gotten it! Qadar says you could not have gotten it. What you've gotten is what you have gotten. وَلَا تَفْرَحُوا۟ بِمَآ ءَاتَاكُمْ (You do not become arrogant and boastful with what you have). Because Allah is The One Who gave it to you.", "It's not like what Qarun (Korah) says (alQasas28:78): \"I was given it because of.. I'm a businessman! My knowledge and my.. I am always able to get this, that's why I'm rich. I'm not like these idiots who don't know what to do.\" Allah is The One Who gives you that money; there are people smarter than you and they don't have the money, there are people more intelligent than you and they don't have the money. So, once you understand this concept of Qadar, it's very important, Wallahi, it's very important.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “The Situation Of The Ummah, The Disease & The Cure | Al Muwahi