fe. This is the course that I need to take. And this was my journey, and this is how my journey started, studying and all of that.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Why Are You A Muslim?! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yUKKmAWojnc", ((315, "5:15–5:40"), (344, "5:44–6:20"), (386, "6:26–6:53"), (420, "7:00–7:29"), (453, "7:33–7:58"), (481, "8:01–8:10"), (497, "8:17–8:48"), (528, "8:48–9:26"), (572, "9:32–9:48"), (594, "9:54–10:29"),), id: 398)
