#passage(("You cannot read this verse in the Quran and give us your own interpretation. When you go to a Muslim and tell him what you said, they would say to you, okay, can you show me what the prophet said about this verse? Can you show me what the companion said about this verse? You're gonna say no, I just was in the mountains for a while and came to that conclusion. The Muslim would say to you, I can go to the mountain and come up with a different conclusion. And that's why one of the most prolific scholars in Islam said that, using an intellect alone, if you bring two people, each of them will have an opinion. You bring a third person, you have a third opinion. So, you need revelation.", "If you have two or three people disagreeing, there has to be something that brings them together. That is through revelation. How do you get revelation? Through the prophets of God. How do you know that what the prophet brought is revelation? Through establishing what that prophet did, the miracles, the signs that each prophet does. And each book talks about these signs that these prophets do. Why do these books keep saying that these prophets make signs? The reason is to establish that they are true messengers coming from the creator with a message to give you from God. The Quran has these miracles or evidences which you can use to establish prophet Muhammad's a messenger.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “The Muslim Lantern, Sneako and Arab Debate Religion! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QiBVA3ZecoI", ((2044, "34:04–35:39"), (2145, "35:45–36:24"),), id: 409)
