#passage(("When we create something even as human beings, we have for example a manual. A manual with the phone. This is how you operate the phone. You need instructions to know how to operate that thing in the best way. You can look at the guidance come from God as a form of a manual for human beings.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Surprises Sceptical Chemist With The Evidences For Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z1ousrtPzAE", ((263, "4:23–4:37"),), id: 411)
