#passage(("I said there are people who made the claims that they're sent by God, because it's either a reality that God has sent someone or He hasn't. And that is a very serious thing that I need to be careful of. So, if there is someone that is sent by God, and I ignored it, and there is a consequence for that, that would be just stupid for ignoring the Message of God.", "You see your brain, which is relatively big when it comes to the size. Now, how many ants can fit in this brain of yours? Probably thousands of ants. They're very, very small ants. You can even go to hundreds of thousands. Now, this very, very small ant has a military system, has a hierarchy and a queen system, have prisoners and prisoner guards. They make literal prisons. They store their food. They work in an army kind of battlefield. Now, what guided this ant that doesn't even have a brain, that even humans until this day cannot even learn some of these tactics? What guided it to do this?", "I'm not assuming. We've already agreed that whatever brought the universe into existence is that higher power or Creator. Now, that Creator literally created the ant because it created the universe. So, it's not about assumptions anymore. It's a reality. So, if the Creator have guided this ant or whoever else is in the universe to behave in the way that they behave, like the trees, like everything, working in a system, the human beings, rationally, are not going to be the odd one out.", "Now, we said there are many people that were sent throughout history that claim that they are sent by that God. So, what a rational person would do is to investigate the claim of that person that is saying, I'm sent by a Creator, I have evidence that I'm from God, The Creator wants x, y, and z from you, hypothetically. Now, what a rational person would do is to listen. Or you could say, I'm not going to listen! I'm going to do whatever I want. And then when you die, you end up receiving the consequence of whatever that Message was. So, all what we're saying here is the rational course of actions that you would take is to investigate that religion that comes from God. Now, after that, you come to a conclusion, whether that comes from the Creator or doesn't come from the Creator.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “\"Enlightened\" Athiest Left Speechless After Encountering Muslim! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UWPH8DYyBGA", ((1228, "20:28–20:49"), (1279, "21:19–22:01"), (1323, "22:03–22:27"), (1351, "22:31–23:19"),), id: 412)
