#passage(("The point is this: I believe that someone who believes in a higher power but does not believe in any guidance, I believe it is the most irrational position a person can hold! Why? Because you would ignore the fact that Allah created all of this creation, guided everything within, even the ants! The termites! Things are smaller than the ants, they have a system, they have a ventilation, very sophisticated ventilation system that they make; they don't have anything close to a brain!", "And then you have something called, even if you don't believe the name, which is the فطرة: you know that innately, you know certain right and wrong in your heart. Every human being actually, what we call [conscience]. So God has given you that, guided everything in the creation and send multiple people throughout time that you heard about: Jesus, Moses, Noah, Abraham, Adam. And all of them are saying to you \"we are from God\", but you'll claim all of that and you'll say still God didn't send any guidance! Now the question is which Scripture? Which religion is from God? Is the question that you should be asking!",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Atheist Questions Muslim About The Quran! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LGjHVuCEgbE", ((1018, "16:58–17:24"), (1050, "17:30–18:14"),), id: 413)
