#passage(("If someone says, \"I learn about God by myself, you learn about God by yourself,\" how many gods would you have? You're going to have a feminine god, a donkey god, a monkey. People will start making up ideas of God by themselves and then there will be infinite numbers of creators.", "But if God chooses from us, from amongst human beings, a man, a human like you and me, and then He gives him Revelations. But He doesn't only give him revelation, He gives him a Miracle, He gives him a sign. Something that he can show you that he is actually a Messenger. Because if I say \"I'm a Messenger\", you'll say \"I don't believe you.\" But if I start flying right now and I bring the moon and I come down and then I say to you, \"That's not my power, this is God's power\", would you then accept that I'm a Messenger or not? If you see in front of your eyes, you'd accept. So what Allah does: these Messengers and prophets He sends to different localities, different people, and He equips them with this type of evidence. Something that you and me cannot do, something that breaks the laws of human beings, the natural laws of what me and you can do.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Why Should I Accept Your Religion?! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rBgIryv7XPM", ((111, "1:51–2:02"), (128, "2:08–2:51"),), id: 418)
