#passage(("We have a big head and we have a big brain inside of it, to process information. Now, the ant is this big and there's even smaller ants. This small ant has colonies, has prison systems, have hierarchy and a queen system, and armies, fighting battles; they carry the dead and bury them. They do fascinating things. Who guided them? The Creator who created them. So, that Creator that created everything in this universe has guided it. Now, we're not the odd ones out. That's why God sends us Prophets and Messengers.", "Those Prophets and Messengers come with proofs. But since there are no Prophets walking today, then there's evidences like the ones I mentioned to you. There's still clear evidences that's from God, but it's things you can investigate today without the need of the presence of the actual Prophets standing there. So, if the things I was telling you were true, and they are true, the prophecies of the future and evidences for Islam and this and that, then does that not mean for a fact that Prophet Muhammad has to be a Messenger of God, by definition? Because otherwise, he cannot know. And if he is the Messenger of God, then shouldn't we be following that Messenger of God? Which is essentially following God, because God is The One Who sent that Messenger.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Refuses To Accept Rational Evidences For Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KFpgNsX6nJ4", ((1011, "16:51–17:23"), (1048, "17:28–18:19"),), id: 423)
