#passage(("He says to us that if you obey, you'll get rewards. Prophet Muhammad tells us about the Afterlife, that if you become a good Muslim and you practise Islam, you will have a reward in the afterlife. Now, someone can say: \"I've not seen the Afterlife\". I will say to you when Prophet Muhammad made those predictions, no one saw them too! But today, we're seeing them. It is the same paradigm. Just like he told us about these issues and it's happening today, he told us about the Afterlife and we will see it when we die. So, he says to us that there's Reward and there is Punishment.", "And what is going to make you, as a human being, content, is going to make you happy, is going to make you have fulfillment in your life? It's to obey the Creator. It's to follow the Messenger that's been sent to you, that is giving you guidance that makes your life better. You will have anxiety, you will have depression. We all have these times in which we're not happy because we're not connected to the Creator. The more you connect to the Creator, the less you would have these issues, the less you would have this anxiety, the less you will ask questions: Why am I here? Where am I gonna go? What is the purpose of life? All of these questions that you're asking are answered here in the Quran.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Why Should I Accept Your Religion?! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rBgIryv7XPM", ((509, "8:29–8:56"), (543, "9:03–9:35"),), id: 428)
