#passage(("It's not a trend. These people were separated by hundreds of years if not thousands sometimes between each other. So, the difference between Prophet Muhammad and Jesus is hundreds of years. The difference between Jesus and Moses for example, and Abraham, etc., 1000s of years, if you look at it between Abraham and Jesus for example. So, it's not like that people saw something on social media and started doing it! No, that's not the case. The fact and reality is that when God saw the people deviating from the Message of God, He sent another Prophet and Messenger with another Message to bring them back to the Truth.", "Why we don't see a Prophet and Messenger today? Because the Message of Islam is preserved. Allah preserved the Message of Prophet Mohammed, and after Prophet Mohammedﷺ, there was a globalization of communication. So you can communicate with someone, like I'm communicating with you right now, communicating with you around somewhere else in the world. So now it's easy for the Message to reach everyone, and the Message is there and preserved. There is no need for God to send another Messenger to say the same thing. So Allah will send another Messenger to say the same thing: worship Allah alone, do not eat pork, do not drink alcohol? The Message is there; the purpose of the Messenger is to give the Message. But back then there was no global communication, for example, and there were different groups, and they were isolated from each other. So Allah sent to every Nation a Messenger separate.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Lady Questions Muslim On Evidence Of God! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Nk4EM0u0VNs", ((1830, "30:30–31:07"), (1871, "31:11–31:56"),), id: 429)

